在也，足下何為者而入？」代王乃謂太尉。太尉往諭，謁者十人皆掊兵而去。代王遂入而聽政。夜，有司分部誅滅梁、淮陽、常山王及少帝於邸。代王立為天子。二十三年崩，謚為孝文皇帝。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"興居","kind":"person","person_id":"pdj_awg_50i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"滕公","kind":"person","person_id":"li9_cmb_8ci","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"少帝","kind":"person","person_id":"zht_ze7_m2d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0072","start":72,"end":75,"surface":"宦者令","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定官稱；不補造姓名或把身世指控當定論。"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"張澤","kind":"person","person_id":"h55_n0n_dfm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"滕公","kind":"person","person_id":"li9_cmb_8ci","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"少帝","kind":"person","person_id":"zht_ze7_m2d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"少帝","kind":"person","person_id":"zht_ze7_m2d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"滕公","kind":"person","person_id":"li9_cmb_8ci","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m031-0154","start":154,"end":158,"surface":"謁者十人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定官稱；不補造姓名或把身世